    "Keep Haptune open on your Watch while you practise. Tip: Watch Settings > General > Return to Clock > Haptune > Return to App.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "练习时请在手表上保持 Haptune 打开。提示：手表“设置”>“通用”>“返回时钟”>“Haptune”>“返回应用”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "練習時請在手錶上保持 Haptune 開啟。提示：手錶「設定」>「一般」>「返回時鐘」>「Haptune」>「返回 App」。"
          }
        },
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Biarkan Haptune terbuka pada Jam semasa berlatih. Petua: Tetapan Jam > Umum > Kembali ke Jam > Haptune > Kembali ke Aplikasi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep your %lld-day streak going. Even 10 minutes counts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
