    "Your purchase is waiting for approval (Ask to Buy).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的购买正在等待批准（询问购买）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的購買正在等待批准（購買前詢問）。"
          }
        },
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pembelian anda menunggu kelulusan (Minta untuk Beli)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your recording is uploaded to your Haptune server, split, and deleted after 24 hours.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的录音会上传到你的 Haptune 服务器进行分轨，并在 24 小时后删除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的錄音會上傳到你的 Haptune 伺服器進行分軌，並在 24 小時後刪除。"
          }
        },
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rakaman anda dimuat naik ke pelayan Haptune anda, dipisahkan, dan dipadam selepas 24 jam."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your takes will appear here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的练习记录会显示在这里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的練習紀錄會顯示在這裡。"
          }
        },
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Latihan anda akan dipaparkan di sini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your teacher plays it once; Haptune writes it down.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "老师演奏一遍，Haptune 帮你写下来。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "老師演奏一遍，Haptune 幫你寫下來。"
          }
        },
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guru anda memainkannya sekali; Haptune menulisnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your wrist taps you the moment a note is wrong, sharp, flat, rushed or dragged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音弹错、偏高、偏低、抢拍或拖拍时，手腕会立即轻触提醒你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音彈錯、偏高、偏低、搶拍或拖拍時，手腕會立即輕觸提醒你。"
          }
        },
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pergelangan tangan anda diketuk sebaik sahaja not salah, terlalu tinggi, terlalu rendah, tergesa-gesa atau terlambat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
